      - "Strictly map to functional type 'hallway'. DO NOT COUNT THIS in 'total_rooms_detected'."
    - "SPECIAL DETECTION: TOILET (WC):"
      - "Identify if labeled 'Toilet', 'トイレ', 'WC', 'Restroom', or visually depicted."
      - "Strictly map to type 'toilet'."
    - "SPECIAL DETECTION: BED CLASSIFICATION (CRITICAL):"
      - "TYPE A 'FUTON': Text says 'Futon'/'布団' OR visual is a mattress on floor."
      - "TYPE B 'BED_STANDARD' (Bed #2): Text says 'Bed 2', 'Bed ②', 'Standard Bed', or 'Normal Bed'."
      - "TYPE C 'BED_NURSING' (Bed #1): The DEFAULT for ANY 'Bed' label/shape that is not explicitly Type A or B. MUST BE SINGLE."
    - "SPECIAL DETECTION: WHEELCHAIR (KURUMAISU):"
      - "Identify if labeled 'Wheelchair', '車いす', '車椅子', or visually depicted."
      - "Strictly map to type 'wheelchair'."
    - "SPECIAL DETECTION: GENKAN (ENTRANCE):"
      - "Identify the main entrance area if labeled 'Genkan' or '玄関'."
      - "Check for shoe storage (Getabako) indications."
    - "SPECIAL DETECTION: DINING TABLE:"
      - "Identify if labeled 'Table', 'Dining', or 'テーブル'."
      - "Default to 'dining_table' type."
    - "SPECIAL DETECTION: KOTATSU (HEATED TABLE):"
      - "Identify if labeled 'Kotatsu', 'こたつ', or 'コタツ'."
