      - "Strictly map to type 'tansu'. Do NOT use if label is missing."
    - "SPECIAL DETECTION: WASHING MACHINE (SENTAKUKI):"
      - "Identify if labeled 'Washing Machine' or '洗濯機'."
      - "Strictly map to type 'washing_machine'. Do NOT use if label is missing."
    - "SPECIAL DETECTION: STAIRS (KAIDAN):"
